@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Licenseserver a owl:Class .
hpc:Remotelicenseserver a owl:Class .
hpc:Locallicenseserver a owl:Class .
hpc:Remoteagenthost a owl:Class .
hpc:Remotelmstatserver a owl:Class .

hpc:Haslicenseserver rdfs:domain hpc:Remoteagenthost ;
                      rdfs:range hpc:Licenseserver .
hpc:Serves rdfs:domain hpc:Licenseserver ;
             rdfs:range hpc:Remotelicenseserver .
hpc:Isremotelmstatserverfor rdfs:domain hpc:Remotelicenseserver ;
                          rdfs:range hpc:Remotelmstatserver .
hpc:Isinsamesubnet rdfs:domain hpc:Remotelicenseserver ;
                    rdfs:range hpc:Remotelicenseserver .


This ontology fragment defines classes for `LicenseServer`, `LocalLicenseServer`, `RemoteLicenseServer`, `RemoteAgentHost`, and `RemoteLMSTATServer`. It also defines object properties for `hasLicenseServer`, `serves`, `isRemoteLMSTATServerFor`, and `isInSameSubnet`. The `hasLicenseServer` property links a `RemoteAgentHost` to its associated `LicenseServer`, the `serves` property indicates which `RemoteLicenseServer` a `LicenseServer` serves, the `isRemoteLMSTATServerFor` property indicates which `RemoteLicenseServer` a `RemoteLMSTATServer` serves, and the `isInSameSubnet` property indicates which `RemoteLicenseServer` instances are in the same subnet.
